### Attribute-Matched Criteria

1. **Correct Dependencies (com.azure, not com.microsoft.azure)** — Uses com.azure group ID for all Azure SDK packages. No com.microsoft.azure (legacy SDK) dependencies. Includes azure-identity for authentication.
